000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ISAMSTAT.
000300*    QISAM LOAD-MODE FILE STATUS: 00, THEN 22 FOR A DUPLICATE KEY,
000400*    21 FOR A KEY OUT OF SEQUENCE, AND LOADING CONTINUES AFTER BOTH.
000500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000700 FILE-CONTROL.
