000900         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001000         RECORD KEY IS DESC-KEY
001100         FILE STATUS IS WS-ST.
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 FILE SECTION.
001400 FD  DESCIDX
001500     BLOCK CONTAINS 10 RECORDS
001600     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001700     RECORD CONTAINS 81 CHARACTERS.
001800 01  DESC-RECORD.
001900     05  DESC-DELETE     PIC X.
002000     05  DESC-KEY        PIC 9(10).
